				<title>SCP-087</title>
				<link>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-087</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;heritage-emblem&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/heritage-collection-arc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/component:heritage-rating/scp-heritage-v3.png&quot; alt=&quot;scp-heritage-v3.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/letitia213&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2353778&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606482990&quot; alt=&quot;Letitia213&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2353778)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/letitia213&quot;  &gt;Letitia213&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
