						 <span class="myPreview" style="display: none;">此工具可以帮助你预览并调试你的 CSS 版式在 SCP 维基上的整体效果</span> <div class="unmargined" style="margin: 0 auto 20px; background-color: #9cf; border: solid 1px #9cf; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.25), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.8), inset 0 10px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.6), inset 0 -15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2); text-align: center; width: 500px;"> <p><a class="unmargined" style="display: block; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 250%; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; text-shadow: 1px 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.5);" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--code/css-previewer/1" target="_blank"><br /> <span style="line-height: 1;">点击这里加载 CSS 预览器</span><br /></a></p> <div class="unmargined" style="margin: 20px 0; color: #fff;"> <p>此工具可以帮助你预览并调试你的 CSS 版式在 SCP 维基上的整体效果</p> </div> <div class="unmargined" style="margin: 20px 0; font-size: 120%; color: #fff;"> <p>初学者？不妨看一看由 <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/7happy7" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3427263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606482991" alt="7happy7" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3427263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/7happy7" >7happy7</a></span> 编写的 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/css-theme-preparation-tool">CSS 版式制作工具</a></p> </div> <div class="unmargined" style="margin: 20px 0;"> <div> <div class="creditRate"> <div class="creditButtonStandalone"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p><strong>CSS 预览器</strong></p> <p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sekai-s" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4476849&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606482991" alt="Sekai_s" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4476849)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sekai-s" >Sekai_s</a></span><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sekai-s-personnel-file">前往我的作者页</a>查看更多作品</p> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;显示源代码</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏源代码</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong>控制台：</strong></p> <div class="code"> <div class="hl-main"> <pre> <span class="hl-brackets">&lt;</span><span class="hl-reserved">html</span><span class="hl-brackets">&gt;</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-brackets">&lt;</span><span class="hl-reserved">head</span><span class="hl-brackets">&gt;</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-brackets">&lt;</span><span class="hl-reserved">title</span><span class="hl-brackets">&gt;</span><span class="hl-code">CSS 预览器 - SCP 基金会</span><